T1 -[hidden]down-> P1
P1 -[hidden]down-> D1
T2 -[hidden]down-> P2
P2 -[hidden]down-> D2
V0 -[hidden]down-> Vis
Vis -[hidden]down-> V2
T3 -[hidden]down-> P3
P3 -[hidden]down-> D3
T4 -[hidden]down-> P4
P4 -[hidden]down-> D4

